@baseUrl = https://localhost:7241
@receiptId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@accountId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002

### Explicit confirmation: reuse the requestId only when retrying this identical payload
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/income-receipts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "receivedDate": "2026-09-15",
  "amount": 100,
  "allocations": [{ "accountId": "{{accountId}}", "amount": 100 }],
  "requestId": "24a64eac-0cb4-41fc-876b-96a6e8cd223f"
}

### Correct an actual receipt (use identifiers returned by the API)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/income-receipts/{{receiptId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "receivedDate": "2026-09-16",
  "amount": 120,
  "allocations": [{ "accountId": "{{accountId}}", "amount": 120 }]
}

### Delete a mistaken receipt
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/income-receipts/{{receiptId}}

### Standalone reflection: 404 until first saved
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/months/2026/9/reflection

### Save optional reflection independently of a plan
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/months/2026/9/reflection
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "whatWorked": "Cooking at home made necessities easier to plan.",
  "nextMonthIntention": "Plan meals before shopping."
}

### Record an optionally described expense
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/days/2026-09-16/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "{{accountId}}",
  "amount": 24.50,
  "classification": "Necessities",
  "description": "Groceries"
}

### Review signed cashflowDifference, not an account balance or realized savings
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/months/2026/9/budget-review
